			<Item class="Script" referent="RBX306">
				<Properties>
					<bool name="Disabled">true</bool>
					<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
					<string name="Name">Please Read</string>
					<ProtectedString name="Source">-- INSTRUCTIONS --

--Simply copy the decals from their items and paste them onto any part. Ordinary meshes can be decaled as well. If it doesn&apos;t work, then just apply it
--as if you&apos;re retexturing a mesh (if you don&apos;t know how to do that PM me and I&apos;ll tell you)

--These textures are seamless, so it will look like one big texture if you make a bunch of bricks with the same texture.
--You don&apos;t HAVE to give credit, but if you did it would be GREATLY GREATLY GREATLY appreciated, since then people will know about my textures
--and use them in their games, so they give credit, and then people can turn to me for making textures for them. That&apos;s my goal.

--So have fun with these and PM me any new textures you need. (Wood, water, ect)</ProtectedString>
				</Properties>
			</Item>
